  "strengths": [
    "uses a triangular-pluck bridge-force spectrum with coherent release phase instead of an arbitrary harmonic phase cloud",
    "separates steel-string source, bridge transfer and guitar-body/air radiation into a causal rendering path",
    "uses a short colored pick/string contact burst without a separate pitched click oscillator",
    "adds a persistent six-string/bridge/body state contract while preserving the AG07 audio path exactly when coupling is zero"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "AG08-S1 is a state-skeleton candidate: all coupling/memory gains are zero and therefore intentionally inaudible",
    "same-string continuity, shared body memory, sympathetic coupling and technique-state transitions are activated only in later AG08 slices after preservation gates",
    "generic project-authored state dimensions are not a measured or named-instrument response"
  ],
  "recommended_roles": [
